","local_name":"bob-cli-j9.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-j9","agent_clan_generation":"20261109121919","bead_id":"bob-cli-j9.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-j9[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Capture alias typing tips[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]When Bryan Shift-types a capture sigil that an unshifted alias key [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]would have typed at that exact spot, the list or picker the sigil [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]opens shows one bob-proved \"Next time\" line in its first frame. The[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]tip fades as the alias becomes habit, and it never slows or changes[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]capture.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]capture_alias_typing_tips.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/capture_alias_typing_tips.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-j9[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-j9/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob proves tips and stamps alias ids[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-alias-tips[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-alias-tips: stamp an AliasId on every forward sigil alias, add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sigil_alias_tip reverse check that runs the whole rewrite pipeline, emit[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tip and alias JSON from capture-rewrite, and pin it with round-trip, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]negative, and CLI tests plus docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Portable tip model, policy, and ledger[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-tip-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-tip-core: decode the new capture-rewrite fields in CaptureCore and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add the lesson map, presentation strings, the pure fade-by-fluency [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]policy, session rules, and the UserDefaults JSON ledger with weekly [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]counts, all unit-tested.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Trigger, tip lane, and the completion-list host[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-completion-tips[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-alias-tips, mac-tip-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-completion-tips: record physically Shift- or Option-typed @ and # [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sigils, run the non-blocking alias-tip lane, admit tips only in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list's first frame, count adoption and escapes, add the Settings toggle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and reset, pin the shared tip row in CompletionList, and add the Typing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tips docs page.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The picker host for the remaining lessons[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-picker-tips[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-completion-tips[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-picker-tips: widen the trigger to ^ : + ~ & *, admit tips in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker's first frame in the chosen slot, add accessibility, escapes, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests, and docs, apply the accepted memory decisions, and propose the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]three-week stop-rule review.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-j9","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonne